    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 8, 2026<br><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 8, 2026</p><p>This Disclaimer governs the use of the Aviantestpro website, products, laboratory services, reports, genetic testing services, molecular biology services, educational materials, and all related content and communications (collectively, the “Services”).</p><p>By accessing or using this website and related Services, you acknowledge and agree to the terms set forth in this Disclaimer.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>1. General Information Only</h2><p>All information provided on this website is for:</p><ul><li>General informational purposes</li><li>Scientific reference purposes</li><li>Educational purposes</li><li>Laboratory service descriptions</li><li>Research and technical communication</li></ul><p>Content published on this website should not be interpreted as:</p><ul><li>Medical advice</li><li>Veterinary diagnosis</li><li>Clinical treatment advice</li><li>Legal advice</li><li>Regulatory certification</li><li>Government approval statement</li><li>Professional healthcare recommendation</li></ul><p>Users are solely responsible for independently evaluating the suitability, legality, and appropriateness of any product or service in their jurisdiction.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>2. No Human Medical Testing or Human Diagnostic Services</h2><p>Aviantestpro does NOT provide:</p><ul><li>Human medical testing</li><li>Human clinical diagnostic services</li><li>Human disease diagnosis</li><li>Human genetic diagnosis</li><li>Human healthcare services</li><li>Human medical treatment recommendations</li><li>Human reproductive testing</li><li>Human ancestry services</li><li>Human pharmaceutical services</li></ul><p>All services, products, and laboratory activities described on this website are intended exclusively for:</p><ul><li>Avian applications</li><li>Bird DNA identification</li><li>Bird species-related laboratory analysis</li><li>Animal-related laboratory support</li><li>Veterinary research support</li><li>Educational and scientific laboratory purposes</li><li>Non-human biological testing applications</li></ul><p>This website and its services are not designed, marketed, or intended for human medical use.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>3. No Veterinary Diagnosis Relationship</h2><p>Although Aviantestpro may provide laboratory testing support or analytical reports related to avian or animal samples, such services do not establish:</p><ul><li>A veterinarian-client relationship</li><li>Veterinary diagnosis relationship</li><li>Clinical treatment relationship</li><li>Medical consultation relationship</li></ul><p>Laboratory reports and test results should always be interpreted by appropriately qualified professionals where required.</p><p>Aviantestpro does not guarantee that any laboratory result alone is sufficient to establish a medical, veterinary, breeding, legal, or commercial decision.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>4. Legal and Regulatory Compliance</h2><p>Aviantestpro operates under the principle that bird DNA testing, avian molecular testing, and related laboratory services provided through this website are intended only for lawful purposes.</p><p>Users are responsible for ensuring that:</p><ul><li>Sample submission is lawful in their jurisdiction</li><li>Ownership or authorization for submitted samples exists</li><li>Import/export requirements are followed</li><li>Local animal, wildlife, biosecurity, and laboratory regulations are respected</li><li>Use of laboratory reports complies with local laws</li></ul><p>To the best of our knowledge, the avian DNA testing services described on this website are legally used in many jurisdictions worldwide for legitimate non-human laboratory, breeding, identification, educational, and scientific purposes.</p><p>However, laws and regulations may vary by country, state, province, or region. Aviantestpro does not guarantee that all services are permitted in every jurisdiction.</p><p>Users are solely responsible for ensuring compliance with applicable local laws.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>5. No Guaranteed Outcomes</h2><p>While Aviantestpro strives to maintain high laboratory standards and quality-control procedures, we do not guarantee:</p><ul><li>Specific testing outcomes</li><li>Commercial breeding outcomes</li><li>Genetic performance outcomes</li><li>Business or financial outcomes</li><li>Competition performance outcomes</li><li>Biological outcomes</li><li>Regulatory acceptance of reports</li><li>Third-party recognition of laboratory reports</li></ul><p>Laboratory science inherently involves biological variability, sampling limitations, technical limitations, environmental factors, and interpretive uncertainty.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>6. Research Use and Educational Use</h2><p>Certain products, testing kits, reagents, reports, protocols, or laboratory materials referenced on this website may be intended for:</p><ul><li>Research use only (RUO)</li><li>Educational use</li><li>Laboratory use</li><li>Professional use</li><li>Non-clinical applications</li></ul><p>Unless explicitly stated otherwise in writing, products and services are not intended for:</p><ul><li>Human therapeutic use</li><li>Human in vivo use</li><li>Clinical diagnostic use</li><li>Human consumption</li><li>Pharmaceutical treatment</li></ul><p>Users are responsible for determining whether products are appropriate for their intended use.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>7. Accuracy of Information</h2><p>We make reasonable efforts to keep website information accurate and updated. However, Aviantestpro does not warrant that:</p><ul><li>Website content is always complete</li><li>Technical information is error-free</li><li>Scientific references remain current</li><li>Product descriptions are always updated immediately</li><li>Regulatory information is universally applicable</li></ul><p>Scientific knowledge, regulations, testing methodologies, and industry practices may change over time.</p><p>Website content may be updated, modified, suspended, or removed without notice.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>8. Third-Party Content and External Links</h2><p>This website may contain:</p><ul><li>Third-party references</li><li>External website links</li><li>Research citations</li><li>Laboratory references</li><li>Educational materials</li><li>Industry resources</li></ul><p>Aviantestpro does not control or guarantee the accuracy, legality, security, or reliability of third-party content.</p><p>Inclusion of external references does not constitute endorsement.</p><p>Users access third-party services and websites at their own risk.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>9. International Use Disclaimer</h2><p>This website may be accessed internationally.</p><p>Aviantestpro makes no representation that all products, services, or website content are appropriate or legally available in every jurisdiction.</p><p>Users accessing the website from outside the operating jurisdiction of Aviantestpro do so on their own initiative and are responsible for compliance with local laws.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2><p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Aviantestpro and its owners, affiliates, officers, employees, laboratories, partners, suppliers, and service providers shall not be liable for:</p><ul><li>Direct damages</li><li>Indirect damages</li><li>Incidental damages</li><li>Consequential damages</li><li>Loss of profits</li><li>Loss of business opportunities</li><li>Loss of data</li><li>Sample degradation or transport issues</li><li>Delays in testing or reporting</li><li>Misinterpretation of results</li><li>Regulatory disputes</li><li>Third-party actions</li></ul><p>This limitation applies whether claims arise under contract, tort, negligence, strict liability, or other legal theories.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>11. Sample Submission Disclaimer</h2><p>Users submitting biological samples acknowledge and agree that:</p><ul><li>Samples are submitted voluntarily</li><li>Users have authority to submit the samples</li><li>Samples comply with shipping and biosafety requirements</li><li>International shipping laws may apply</li><li>Biological degradation can occur during transport</li><li>Results may be affected by sample quality</li></ul><p>Aviantestpro reserves the right to reject, suspend, dispose of, or refuse testing of samples that:</p><ul><li>Violate legal requirements</li><li>Present biosafety concerns</li><li>Are improperly packaged</li><li>Are damaged or contaminated</li><li>Are prohibited under applicable law</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>12. AI, Search Engines, and Automated Systems</h2><p>Public content on this website may be indexed, summarized, cached, or analyzed by:</p><ul><li>Search engines</li><li>AI search systems</li><li>Automated crawlers</li><li>Language models</li><li>Web indexing technologies</li></ul><p>Public website content is intended for informational visibility and educational communication.</p><p>Confidential customer information and private laboratory submissions are not intentionally published for public indexing.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>13. Intellectual Property Disclaimer</h2><p>All website content, including:</p><ul><li>Text</li><li>Logos</li><li>Graphics</li><li>Laboratory descriptions</li><li>Protocols</li><li>Reports</li><li>Website design</li><li>Technical content</li></ul><p>is protected by applicable intellectual property laws unless otherwise stated.</p><p>Unauthorized copying, redistribution, commercial reproduction, or misuse may violate applicable laws.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>14. No Professional Relationship</h2><p>Use of this website does not establish:</p><ul><li>Medical provider relationship</li><li>Veterinary provider relationship</li><li>Legal advisor relationship</li><li>Scientific consulting agreement</li><li>Partnership or agency relationship</li></ul><p>Formal service relationships exist only where explicitly agreed in writing.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>15. Compliance with Google, Platform, and Search Policies</h2><p>Aviantestpro aims to maintain transparent and compliant website practices consistent with:</p><ul><li>Search engine transparency standards</li><li>Platform content policies</li><li>Consumer protection principles</li><li>International privacy standards</li><li>Scientific communication standards</li></ul><p>Website content is intended to describe lawful laboratory-related services and informational content for non-human applications.</p><p>No content on this website should be interpreted as promoting unauthorized medical activity, illegal biological testing, or prohibited healthcare services.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>16. Changes to This Disclaimer</h2><p>We reserve the right to modify, revise, or update this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice.</p><p>Changes become effective immediately upon publication on this page.</p><p>Continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of the revised Disclaimer.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>17. Contact Information</h2><p>If you have questions regarding this Disclaimer or website compliance matters, please contact:</p><p><strong>Aviantestpro Compliance Team</strong><br>Email: <a><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="8aebeee7e3e4caebfce3ebe4feeff9fefaf8e5a4e9e5e7">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br>Website: <a>https://aviantestpro.com</a></p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Recommended Additional Compliance Pages</h2><p>For stronger transparency, trust signals, and international compliance, it is recommended that the website also includes:</p><ul><li>Privacy Policy</li><li>Terms &amp; Conditions</li><li>Cookie Policy</li><li>Shipping Policy</li><li>Refund Policy</li><li>Sample Submission Policy</li><li>Laboratory Use Disclaimer</li><li>Contact Page</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Recommended Website Compliance Features</h2><p>To improve transparency and Google trust signals, the following are recommended:</p><ul><li>Visible company information</li><li>HTTPS/SSL enabled on all pages</li><li>Cookie consent banner</li><li>Terms acceptance during checkout</li><li>Sample submission consent forms</li><li>Contact email matching website domain</li><li>Clear non-human testing statement</li><li>Clear RUO (Research Use Only) labeling where applicable</li><li>Structured data for Organization and Website</li><li>Transparent laboratory process descriptions</li></ul></div></div><p></p></div>`} />
